&lt;li&gt;Experience with using Knowledge Database tools to search databases, create custom queries, and generate reports.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A demonstrated history of customer focus and empathy, including the ability to communicate complex issues to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
